WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.820
To audit a disputed escalation, open the specific ticket from Escalations rather than relying on a queue count.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:12.680
Read Activity for the sequence of events, then expand ladder History for the reason behind the move.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:19.240
Compare that reason with the current rung; the latest position alone cannot tell you why a previous decision was made.
